  "provenance": "Candidate 360 clip. Genuine capture skipped: weather gate (Open-Meteo current retrievals on 2026-10-02 01:35 Europe/Amsterdam, and 19:36 America/Kralendijk for NL-01-065 and NL-01-066, were night, is_day 0, so not mostly-clear daylight). Shipped from the finished daylight 16:9 master on Candidate draft PR #20 tip 17471e23c8f39cd28a15546447e7bc2f0b9059e1 after the 190px label bar was cropped. 10.0s 864x1080 24fps 4:5 synthetic orbit: daylight 4:5 crop at 0 degrees, generated views at about 60, 120, and 180 degrees, joined by optical-flow interpolation. First frame is that daylight crop. Not a field capture. Not a drift-only push-in. In-between frames are motion-compensated blends and can ghost. Not Cosmo-approved. The night master was not modified.",
